        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nOpen Viewing\nTuesday 25/08/2026 @5.30pm - 5:55pm\nRAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present 2 Thomastown Road, Glenageary, Co. Dublin, A96 R7F2 to the market a superb four-bedroom, two-bathroom semi-detached family home ideally positioned on this mature and highly sought-after residential road. Glenageary is one of South Dublin's most desirable locations, offering the perfect balance of suburban tranquility and exceptional convenience.\nA fantastic range of amenities are within easy reach including the villages of Glenageary, Dalkey and Dun Laoghaire, with an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, boutiques and local shops. The property is just a 10-minute drive from both Killiney Beach and Dun Laoghaire, while an abundance of parks and green spaces are on your doorstep, providing excellent recreational opportunities for families and outdoor enthusiasts alike. Golf lovers will also appreciate the close proximity of Killiney Golf Club, which is just a 10-minute walk away. The area is further enhanced by excellent transport links, including nearby DART stations, Dublin Bus services and easy access to the N11 and M50.\nBright and spacious internal living accommodation spans to approximately 119 sqm, and comprises of entrance hallway, generous lounge, dining room, fully fitted kitchen, guest W/C, and sun room, on the ground floor. Upstairs hosts four well-proportioned bedrooms together with a family bathroom. The property offers an excellent layout with bright, well-balanced accommodation throughout, perfectly suited to modern family living.\nExternally, No. 2 boasts a sunny rear garden laid in lawn, offering an ideal space for outdoor entertaining, gardening or family enjoyment. The property further benefits from a side entrance, oil fired central heating and a garage, providing excellent storage with further potential for conversion, subject to the necessary planning permissions.\nComing to the market with the added benefit of no onward chain, No. 2 presents a wonderful opportunity for growing families seeking a forever home in one of South Dublin's most established and desirable residential locations. Combining generous accommodation, superb outdoor space and an exceptional location, this property is sure to attract strong interest.\nEarly viewing is highly recommended contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to arrange a viewing!\nAdditional Features;\n• c. 119 sqm\n• BER F\n• 4 Bed / 2 Bath\n• Semi detached home\n• Off street parking\n• Oil fired central heating\n• Double glazed windows\n• Fully fitted kitchen\n• Perfect blank canvas\n• Side entrance\n• Sunny rear garden in lawn\n• Bright and airy\n• No onwards chain\n• Well-proportioned layout throughout\n• Plenty of transport links nearby\n• Wide range of local amenities within walking distance\n• Killiney Beach and Dun Laoghaire 10-minute drive\n• Highly sought after location\n• Ideal for a wide range of buyers\n• Viewing highly advised!\nDirections;\nEircode: A96 R7F2"
      },
